            "review_title": "Review at Loving Hut",
            "review_text": "Giang Nguyen (Jade)\nHanoi, Vietnam11 contributions\n0\nPeaceful vibe. Food taste okay. Price is average.\nMar 2023 • Solo\nAbout 40k/person at least for a full serving. Less than that you pretty much don’t have a full meal, so this place isn’t cheap. \n\nFood taste okay, if not too salty for me. It will take a while for the chefs to cook. So don’t be rushed here. \n\nWhat I like most is the atmosphere. Very quiet and tranquil. Maybe I’ll comeback to try some other food.\nRead more\nWritten March 15, 2023",
