            "review_text": "TravelinGypsey\n305 contributions\n0\nDelicious Vegan Food!!\nMar 2020 • Couples\nDelicious Vegan Food!! The go to spot!! Prices are excellent!! Open until 10:00pm- the food is always fresh and flavorful. Some of the best dishes are their Hue noodle soups, fried pineapple and fried pumpkin; the seafood spring rolls & the vegetables are delicious also! Honestly they have tons of options and everything on there menu is delicious. Staff is friendly and great english speaking skills also! \nFollow @travelingypsey on Instagram & Google Maps!\nRead more\nWritten March 21, 2020",
